    <h2>Toasted Almond &amp; Toffee Crunch Architecture</h2>
    <p>Crafted with authentic Heath® bars containing fine slivers of toasted almonds, this Blizzard breaks away from peanut-dominated fast-food classics. At 480 calories for a Small and starting at $3.49 (Mini), it delivers satisfying crunch density without excessive heaviness. Discover every candy and cookie pairing across <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

