      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Who Will Best Appreciate the Heath Blizzard</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Toffee &amp; Brittle Connoisseurs:</strong> Those who relish authentic buttery caramelized sugar candy over soft whipped nougats.</li>
      <li><strong>Tree Nut Lovers:</strong> The roasted almond fragments offer an earthy crunch distinctly different from common peanut butter mix-ins.</li>
      <li><strong>Discerning Sweet Tooth:</strong> At 480 calories for a Small, it provides complex flavor balance without tipping into the 900+ calorie range of extreme triple-chocolate sundaes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Allergen Note</h2>
    <p>The Heath® Bar Blizzard contains tree nuts (almonds) in addition to standard milk and soy allergens. Not suitable for guests with tree nut allergies. Consider the <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Blizzard</a> or <a href="/items/mm-blizzard">M&amp;M's Blizzard</a> for nut-free alternatives.</p>

